event_inherited();

array_push(_dialogs, $"Hey! You're a local, right? Got any recs on the best spots to hit around here?");
array_push(_dialogs, $"Aw, but this place is such a vibe! When'll they get the point? If we wanted access to all the same things we have access to back in the city, then we'd just stay in the city!");
array_push(_dialogs, $"She snaps a shot of the leaflet before frantically tapping her ballerina acrylics on the screen. You wait patiently…");
array_push(_dialogs, $"I'll get the rest of the group to share about this on their socials when they get here as well! It's been such a wonderful trip and we'd love to help!");